
# Assignment 4.2 — Job Application Form

## 1. Objective

To create a job application form using different HTML input types. The form includes personal details, date of birth, portfolio URL, radio buttons, checkboxes, a dropdown menu, a cover letter textarea, a disabled field, and a submit button.

## 2. HTML Code (job-application.html)

Create a file named `job-application.html` and add the following code:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Job Application Form</title>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Job Application Form</h1>
        <p>Please complete the form below to apply for a job position.</p>
    </header>

    <hr>

    <main>
        <form action="#" method="post">

            <fieldset>
                <legend>Personal Information</legend>

